#
# Client (consumer) authentication
#
# Format:
#	MOUNTPOINT:username:password
#
# Only mountpoints listed here require authentication.
# Mountpoints not listed remain publicly accessible.
#
# Use "*" as the mountpoint to declare a master user whose credentials
# grant access to every base, including those with their own explicit entry.
# Other users must use the credentials defined for each specific mountpoint.
#
# Example:
#FAZENDA01:usuario_leitor:senha_leitura
#*:tiago:12345678
